How to create a volume and Allocate to the instance

While creating a new instance in configure storage tab click on "Add new volume"

Add extra volume and launch instance

Now Connect the instance to allocate the storage

Here you can see the storage of 30 gb only because, the 4gb we added is unallocated

To allocate the 4gb, Right click on 'Start button' -> Disk management.  Now you can see the storage is unallocated and offline 

First click on offline and make it online

After making it online, now it will show not initialized 

To initialize it click on not initialized and make it initialized

Now Right click on the unallocated 4gb -> new simple storage

Click on next and finish the process, Now the storage will be allocated and it will show in disk.
