Create a new volume and attach it to the existing instance

Click on the create volume button

Select the type and size of the volume 

Now give the details based on the requirement
IOPS	  Input output operation that can be supported by the volume
Throughput 	  Performance of the volume
Availability zone	  It has to be same with the availability zone of the instance you are                going to connect
Snapshot	 If you want you can create or else you can create it separately also 

Click on create button

We have created a new volume, now we're going to connect to the instance

Click on the volume ID 

Go to Actions => Attach volume 

Select the instance. Select the device name and click on attach volume 
You have attached the volume to the instance, go and allocate it as we did above 

