How to modify or add extra volume in the existing volume of an instance

Open the volume and click on modify

You can only increase the previous volume it cannot be decreased
Change the size of the volume, 

Click on modify

The previous volume will be modified but it will be in unallocated state, you have change that into allocated state as we did previously in the document but we are going to extent the volume with the modified volume 
I have changed the volume size from 11gb to 12 gb 

You can see the extra 1gb in unallocated state in the disk management

Right click on the 11gb -> click on extend volume -> Finish

Now you can see that 11gb -> 12gb

